Contacts4
==========

Stage 4 of the address book made in the book "Writing Desktop
Applications in JavaScript" (Manuals.JSApps), chapter 4. This stage
keeps the list up to date by itself, shades menu items that
can't be used, and has keys: Insert (new), Delete, Ctrl-A (select
all), Ctrl-Z (clear the selection).

The finished address book is !Contacts.
